# Run outputs. CLAUDE.md says "recordings and run outputs belong in out/
# (gitignored)" — but until this line, only out/runs/ was ignored, and only
# incidentally, by the **/runs/ pattern above which is not about out/ at all.
# So out/demo/ or any other new subdirectory would have been committed
# silently, videos included. Ignore the directory itself, not a pattern that
# happens to match one child of it.
out/

# Re-include the evaluation package. `**/runs/` above is about Isaac Lab RL
# run outputs; it ALSO matches this repo's own runs/ Python package — the
# sweep driver, the condition bindings, the aggregation and their tests —
# which was therefore invisible to `git status` and would have been omitted
# from every commit silently. Un-exclude the directory ITSELF: a `!runs/**`
# cannot work, because git never descends into an excluded directory.
# Anchored with a leading slash so out/runs/ stays ignored (out/ covers it).
!/runs/

# Generated-world USDs: ~19 MB each and a pure function of (tier, seed), so
# rebuildable with scripts/export_world.py rather than committed. scenes/lab42_v1.usd
# IS committed — it is hand-authored and there is no generator for it.
scenes/generated/

# demo/: the D* paper as handed to armB. NOT redistributed (licence; Mindfire
# plan R10). Their SHA-256 are committed in demo/PAPER.md -- armB's prompt hash
# 4045efb3e514b981 is only reproducible from a paper.txt with that hash.
demo/paper.pdf
demo/paper.txt
